# Every sentence below leaves something open. Run:  ./intent check examples/questions.intent
Customers is a collection.
Each customer has a name, an age (number), a salary (number) and an email.
Emails are unique.

Add a customer.
Transform customers and double it.
Sort the customers.
Show the largest positive age.
Remove a customer.
Show customers by age.
Count the customers over 25.
Show customers whose age is over 60 and salary is under 10 or age is under 18.
